        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the ancient myth of Sisyphus, you are tasked with pushing a gigantic boulder up a hill. Reach each checkpoint before the rising water swallows you whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider this either as a puzzle where the puzzle is getting from point A to point B on a desolate landscape together with a hard-to-control oversized rolling rock. Or consider this a racing game where you  rush over the same set of islands competing against growing rate of water increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full disclosure: this game is largely a one person operation that is developed during spare time. There will be bugs and oddities. There are plans for both QoL and content updates, but without any overly specific timeline. Nonetheless the core functionality is there which is why I will not be labeling this early access, limited demo, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do purchase the game, glad to have you on board and let's see where the boulder rolls.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the ancient myth of Sisyphus, you are tasked with pushing a gigantic boulder up a hill. Reach each checkpoint before the rising water swallows you whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider this either as a puzzle where the puzzle is getting from point A to point B on a desolate landscape together with a hard-to-control oversized rolling rock. Or consider this a racing game where you  rush over the same set of islands competing against growing rate of water increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full disclosure: this game is largely a one person operation that is developed during spare time. There will be bugs and oddities. There are plans for both QoL and content updates, but without any overly specific timeline. Nonetheless the core functionality is there which is why I will not be labeling this early access, limited demo, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do purchase the game, glad to have you on board and let's see where the boulder rolls.</p>",
